{"4575330": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Hiryu no Ken Collection", "steam_appid": 4575330, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hiryu no Ken Collection is a collection title featuring the first four titles in the Hiryu no Ken series, along with two international versions. Centered on mixed martial arts-themed action, each title offers its own distinct gameplay elements, including versus fighting, side-scrolling action, and character growth systems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One of the series’ defining features is the “Shingan System,” in which players aim for points displayed on the opponent’s body to attack and defend, creating a unique style of tactical combat. In addition to its mixed martial arts-inspired gameplay, the series also tells an overarching story about the battle against the evil organization Dragon Fang, which seeks the resurrection of the Great Demon and world domination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this collection, players can enjoy the early titles in the series on PC and experience the differences and unique appeal of each game in a single package.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Included Titles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Hiryu no Ken: Ougi no Sho</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Hiryu no Ken II: Dragon no Tsubasa</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Hiryu no Ken III: Gonin no Ryu Senshi</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Hiryu no Ken Special: Fighting Wars</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Japanese language support only.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Flying Dragon: The Secret Scrolls</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Flying Warriors</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >English language support only.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Save and load anytime.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Customizable key bindings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Rewind feature included.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hiryu no Ken Collection is a collection title featuring the first four titles in the Hiryu no Ken series, along with two international versions. Centered on mixed martial arts-themed action, each title offers its own distinct gameplay elements, including versus fighting, side-scrolling action, and character growth systems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One of the series’ defining features is the “Shingan System,” in which players aim for points displayed on the opponent’s body to attack and defend, creating a unique style of tactical combat. In addition to its mixed martial arts-inspired gameplay, the series also tells an overarching story about the battle against the evil organization Dragon Fang, which seeks the resurrection of the Great Demon and world domination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this collection, players can enjoy the early titles in the series on PC and experience the differences and unique appeal of each game in a single package.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Included Titles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Hiryu no Ken: Ougi no Sho</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Hiryu no Ken II: Dragon no Tsubasa</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Hiryu no Ken III: Gonin no Ryu Senshi</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Hiryu no Ken Special: Fighting Wars</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Japanese language support only.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Flying Dragon: The Secret Scrolls</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Flying Warriors</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >English language support only.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Save and load anytime.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Customizable key bindings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Rewind feature included.</p>", "short_description": "Retro action collection featuring the first four Hiryu no Ken titles plus two international versions. Experience mixed martial arts battles, side-scrolling action, a